WEBVTT

00:01:54.890 --> 00:01:59.390
Man, lately, it seems like no matter
how long I sleep, I still wake up tired.

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:02.270
Perhaps our journey has exhausted you.

00:02:02.270 --> 00:02:04.770
Let us take today to relax.

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:14.410
If you're still sleepy,
might I recommend a nap?

00:02:14.410 --> 00:02:17.160
Well, if you insist.

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:41.390
What is it, Pip?

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:44.980
You'd like to play with someone?

00:02:44.980 --> 00:02:47.650
Unfortunately, Letty is sound asleep.

00:02:48.650 --> 00:02:49.900
You're sure?

00:02:51.360 --> 00:02:52.940
You'll go alone?

00:02:55.990 --> 00:02:58.160
I don't see why not.

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:01.290
But don't stray too far.

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:03.830
And be back before sundown!

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:08.040
And no following suspicious strangers.

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:08.040
I can't get this black bar off'a me!

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:09.630
That's a no-no, all right?

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.500
Suspicious Strangers

00:03:17.220 --> 00:03:19.010
Have fun on your adventure.

